    {
      "heading": "5. TinaCloud PostHog Metrics",
      "body": "![](/uploads/sprint-131/commits.png)\n\nTotal Commits processed by TinaCloud over the last 6 months, total commits (aka spits) over the last month was 39,129 (down 13% on the previous period) - [PostHog Dashboard](https://us.posthog.com/project/237683/dashboard/615466)\n\n![](/uploads/sprint-131/onboarding.png)\n\nUser onboarding over the last 7 days - 144 accounts were created, 26% (38) went on to create a project and 15% (22) committed. Of 107 invited collaborators, 57% (61) were added and 21% (22) committed - [PostHog Dashboard](https://us.posthog.com/project/237683/dashboard/615466)\n\n![](/uploads/sprint-131/projects.png)\n\nOrganisation and project creation over the last 7 days - 147 new organisations, up from 129 last Sprint - [PostHog Dashboard](https://us.posthog.com/project/237683/dashboard/615466)\n",
      "_template": "figures"
    },
    {
      "heading": "6. TinaCMS PostHog Metrics",
      "body": "![](/uploads/sprint-131/dau.png)\n\nDaily active users this month - peaking at 664 in mid-October, and at 633 in early November (dips are weekends) - [PostHog Dashboard](https://us.posthog.com/project/237683/dashboard/1284436)\n\n![](/uploads/sprint-131/geo.png)\n\nDistribution of unique TinaCMS users over the last 30 days - US is our top country with 1,582 users, down 162 on the prior 30 days, ahead of Germany on 650 and the UK on 549 - [PostHog Dashboard](https://us.posthog.com/project/237683/dashboard/1284436)\n",
      "_template": "figures"
    },
